@base = http://127.0.0.1:3000

### 상태
GET {{base}}/health

### 회원가입
POST {{base}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mina@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "nickname": "mina"
}

### 로그인
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mina@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 글 목록
GET {{base}}/api/posts?q=&page=1&limit=10&sort=-createdAt
